@Inventario.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7196

### Login (anónimo)
POST {{Inventario.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "",
  "password": ""
}

### Refresh (anónimo)
POST {{Inventario.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": ""
}

### Logout (Bearer)
POST {{Inventario.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": ""
}

### Change password (Bearer)
POST {{Inventario.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "",
  "newPassword": ""
}

### Me (Bearer)
GET {{Inventario.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
